{"speciesId":688,"names":{"fr":"Opermine","es":"Binacle","en":"Binacle","ja":"カメテテ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Chaque rocher abrite deux Opermine. S’ils se disputent, l’un d’entre eux part à la recherche d’un nouveau logis."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Dos Binacle conviven en la misma roca, pero cuando se produce un altercado entre ambos, uno de ellos se muda a otra."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Two Binacle live together on one rock. When they fight, one of them will move to a different rock."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"２匹の カメテテが ひとつの 岩で 暮らす。ケンカすると どちらかが 他の 岩に 移る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ils prennent de l’élan avec tout leur corps et soulèvent ainsi leur pierre pour se déplacer. Ils mangent les algues échouées sur le rivage."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"El impulso que cogen al erguirse les permite levantar su roca y caminar. Se alimentan de las algas que la marea arrastra hasta la orilla."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"They stretch and then contract, yanking their rocks along with them in bold hops. They eat seaweed that washes up on the shoreline."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"体を 伸ばす 反動で 岩を 持ち上げて 歩く。波打ち際で 流されてきた 海藻を 食べる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Chaque rocher abrite deux Opermine. S’ils se disputent, l’un d’entre eux part à la recherche d’un nouveau logis."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Dos Binacle conviven en la misma roca, pero cuando se produce un altercado entre ambos, uno de ellos se muda a otra."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Two Binacle live together on one rock. When they fight, one of them will move to a different rock."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"２匹の カメテテが ひとつの 岩で 暮らす。ケンカすると どちらかが 他の 岩に 移る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ils prennent de l’élan avec tout leur corps et soulèvent ainsi leur pierre pour se déplacer. Ils mangent les algues échouées sur le rivage."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"El impulso que cogen al erguirse les permite levantar su roca y caminar. Se alimentan de las algas que la marea arrastra hasta la orilla."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"They stretch and then contract, yanking their rocks along with them in bold hops. They eat seaweed that washes up on the shoreline."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体を 伸ばす 反動で 岩を 持ち上げて 歩く。波打ち際で 流されてきた 海藻を 食べる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ils vivent par groupes de deux sur un rocher qui leur convient en bord de mer. À marée haute, le duo coopère pour capturer des proies."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Dos Binacle conviven adheridos a una misma roca a orillas del mar y colaboran para atrapar a sus presas cuando sube la marea."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"After two Binacle find a suitably sized rock, they adhere themselves to it and live together. They cooperate to gather food during high tide."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"２匹が 海辺の 手ごろな 岩に くっついて 暮らす。 満潮時 協力して エサを 集める。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il faut que les deux bras travaillent bien ensemble s’ils souhaitent survivre, sinon leur défense et leur attaque en souffrent grandement."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Si no se llevan bien, no consiguen ni atacar ni defenderse de forma eficaz y sus probabilidades de supervivencia se reducen."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"If the two don’t work well together, both their offense and defense fall apart. Without good teamwork, they won’t survive."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"２匹の 息が 合わないと 攻撃 防御 どちらも おろそかになり 生き残れない。"}],"varieties":[{"id":688,"moves":[{"name":"scratch","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,